<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Protea yr shr surges, div steady.</title>
<headline>Protea yr shr surges, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 115.0    vs  30.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  30.0    vs  30.0</p>
<p>    Net income		  9.02   vs   2.39</p>
<p>    Net written premiums  319.53   vs 317.33</p>
<p>    General business result 6.85   vs   1.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     7.59   vs   2.52</p>
<p>    Attrib profit	     9.02   vs   2.39</p>
<p>    Surplus attrib	   47.98   vs  20.98 deficit</p>
<p>Div payable Oct 14</p>
<p>On register Sept 16</p>
<p>Full name: Protea Assurance Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
